WEBVTT

00:07.570 --> 00:11.820
If you fail to stop me, the world 
will come to an end, Great Hero.

00:18.140 --> 00:19.660
So this is all I've got?

00:42.030 --> 00:44.370
Enough with the cheap moves.

00:44.370 --> 00:46.420
Let's settle things once and for all.

00:46.420 --> 00:48.860
You and me, going all out.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.300
Very well.

00:50.300 --> 00:51.920
I couldn't ask for more.

00:59.370 --> 01:00.920
Dragon Series, Fifth Sword.

01:00.920 --> 01:03.240
Satanic power at full force.

01:06.000 --> 01:07.460
Be reduced to ashes!

01:09.210 --> 01:10.960
Dragon Annihilator!

01:47.170 --> 01:51.860
It's finally over...

02:14.100 --> 02:14.880
Good morning!

02:14.880 --> 02:16.030
Oh, you're here.

02:16.030 --> 02:17.280
Good morning!

02:17.380 --> 02:18.570
Good morning!

02:18.790 --> 02:20.970
Oh! They're greeting each other!

02:20.970 --> 02:22.220
Is that what friends do?!

02:22.220 --> 02:22.860
Good morning!

02:22.860 --> 02:25.040
Morning. You're here early.

02:25.040 --> 02:28.290
I see! This is what normal people do!

02:30.110 --> 02:31.500
All right!

02:31.890 --> 02:37.010
Starting today, I'm going to make friends 
and live life as an ordinary person!

02:38.970 --> 02:42.010
<b>Episode 1</b>

02:39.720 --> 02:42.010
<b>Earnest</b>

02:45.010 --> 02:48.270
Okay! Time to make some friends!

02:48.490 --> 02:49.300
Good morning!

02:49.430 --> 02:50.610
Good morning!

02:50.720 --> 02:51.520
Good morning!

02:51.620 --> 02:52.770
Good morning!

02:52.770 --> 02:55.750
Good morning! Good morning!

02:53.120 --> 02:55.750
Pretty funny student we've got here.

02:56.400 --> 02:58.780
Good morning! Good morning!

02:56.400 --> 02:58.780
Do you think he's a new transfer?

02:59.200 --> 03:01.280
Whoa, he's coming this way!

03:01.720 --> 03:03.100
I'm Blade!

03:03.520 --> 03:04.690
Ah, yes.

03:04.690 --> 03:05.660
It's a pleasure to meet you.

03:06.040 --> 03:07.440
I'm Blade!

03:07.440 --> 03:09.230
You sure are a weirdo.

03:09.230 --> 03:10.440
I'm Kassim.

03:10.440 --> 03:12.000
My name's Clay. Nice to meet you.

03:12.000 --> 03:13.330
I'm Yessica.

03:13.330 --> 03:15.850
Oh, um... I'm Claire.

03:15.850 --> 03:17.360
I see!

03:17.360 --> 03:19.590
I'm here to make some friends!

03:19.590 --> 03:22.360
If you don't mind, would you 
like to be friends with us?

03:22.360 --> 03:23.270
I did it!

03:23.270 --> 03:25.440
I've got four whole friends now!

03:25.440 --> 03:26.760
If this keeps up, I could make ten friends...

03:26.760 --> 03:28.500
No, hold that thought!

03:28.500 --> 03:30.600
Even 100 friends doesn't sound so far-fetched!

03:32.160 --> 03:36.320
If you want to make 100 friends,
you'll have to befriend the whole student body.

03:36.640 --> 03:38.130
What are all of you up to?

03:38.130 --> 03:42.700
Why are you making a commotion 
in the middle of the hallway?

03:42.700 --> 03:44.240
Oh, no!

03:42.700 --> 03:46.550
You are all students at the 
prestigious Rosewood Academy.

03:45.960 --> 03:47.730
That's Earnest Flaming.

03:46.550 --> 03:50.880
You should strive to always follow the 
rules and behave in an orderly manner.

03:47.730 --> 03:51.580
She's the top student in this school, 
so everyone calls her the Empress.

03:51.960 --> 03:53.390
I'm Blade!

03:55.090 --> 03:56.770
Who are you?

03:56.770 --> 03:58.210
I haven't seen you around here.

03:58.210 --> 04:00.450
U-Um, Lady Earnest...

04:00.450 --> 04:02.020
No need for the title!

04:02.660 --> 04:05.840
Well, it seems Blade just 
transferred into the school...

04:05.840 --> 04:07.340
A new student?

04:07.340 --> 04:13.010
This academy only admits those who aspire 
to be heroes who protect this world!

04:13.010 --> 04:14.780
There's no way they'd permit 
such a late admission!

04:14.780 --> 04:16.890
I don't really care about being a hero.

04:16.890 --> 04:18.710
I'm just here to make some friends.

04:18.710 --> 04:19.970
You don't really care?!

04:19.970 --> 04:22.320
What halfhearted resolve you have!

04:25.320 --> 04:26.800
Oh, almost forgot!

04:26.800 --> 04:28.700
I need to go to the headmaster's office!

04:28.700 --> 04:29.700
What?!

04:29.700 --> 04:32.030
Can you show me the way to 
the headmaster's office?

04:32.030 --> 04:33.280
Go!

04:35.530 --> 04:37.080
Why'd it have to be me?

04:39.660 --> 04:41.770
This is Earnest Flaming.

04:41.770 --> 04:45.450
I'm here with a brat who lost his 
way and was on the verge of tears.

04:45.450 --> 04:46.670
You may enter.

04:47.470 --> 04:48.990
Pardon me.

04:56.290 --> 04:59.520
Wh-What brings you here, Sir?!

04:59.520 --> 05:00.730
I'm here!

05:01.990 --> 05:03.510
Y-You idiot!

05:03.510 --> 05:06.260
Don't you have any idea 
who you stand before?!

05:06.260 --> 05:07.240
Sure I do.

05:07.240 --> 05:10.490
Please forgive his rudeness, 
Your Majesty the King!

05:12.840 --> 05:16.290
I've heard all about you from the 
previous headmaster, Miss Earnest.

05:16.290 --> 05:18.210
It seems you have quite the excellent record.

05:18.210 --> 05:20.340
O-Oh, no. I have a long way to go...

05:20.820 --> 05:23.710
Excuse me, "previous headmaster"?

05:23.710 --> 05:24.690
Indeed.

05:24.690 --> 05:28.090
As of today, I will be acting 
as the new headmaster here.

05:28.090 --> 05:29.280
Your Majesty is?!

05:29.280 --> 05:32.690
Why, I hear Your Majesty is 
quite the accomplished warrior!

05:32.690 --> 05:35.130
To be instructed by Your Majesty himself!

05:35.130 --> 05:38.560
I find myself lacking words to 
express my joy at the sheer honor!

05:38.560 --> 05:41.960
I could never have imagined I would get 
a chance to speak with Your Majesty!

05:41.960 --> 05:43.350
How can I put this?

05:43.350 --> 05:45.190
Oh, I really am so truly struck with awe!

05:43.780 --> 05:45.190
That's enough.

05:45.470 --> 05:46.140
Huh?

05:46.710 --> 05:48.660
You may take your leave.

05:48.660 --> 05:51.160
I must speak with him in private.

05:57.470 --> 05:59.670
What's the deal with that boy?!

05:59.670 --> 06:01.320
He's so friendly with His Majesty!

06:01.320 --> 06:03.240
I don't get it!

06:01.320 --> 06:04.050
Hey! Thanks to you,
I've gotten on her bad side!

06:04.050 --> 06:05.050
What could be the reason?

06:05.300 --> 06:06.880
Don't give me that!

06:06.880 --> 06:08.970
And what are you doing here, anyway?!

06:09.400 --> 06:11.470
You see, Blade...

06:11.470 --> 06:15.260
I want you to regain your powers as a hero.

06:15.260 --> 06:17.750
I want to be an ordinary person!

06:17.750 --> 06:18.650
Normal as can be!

06:18.650 --> 06:21.040
The students here are really something.

06:21.040 --> 06:24.160
They should serve well 
in your rehabilitation.

06:24.160 --> 06:25.610
You're not listening, old man.

06:25.920 --> 06:29.490
I plan on making sweeping changes 
to the curriculum, as well.

06:29.490 --> 06:32.380
My predecessor had a bit of a lenient streak.

06:32.860 --> 06:35.570
We're trying to nurture heroes here.

06:35.570 --> 06:37.000
Great heroes like you—

06:37.000 --> 06:39.320
There's no need for that!

06:39.320 --> 06:41.000
The Demon King's gone now.

06:41.000 --> 06:45.170
I received reports of the Great Hero 
and the Demon King trading blows,

06:45.170 --> 06:47.610
resulting in mutual annihilation 
of their powers.

06:47.610 --> 06:48.600
That's right.

06:48.600 --> 06:51.020
But I have faith!

06:51.020 --> 06:53.660
The Great Hero's powers will be resurrected!

06:54.650 --> 06:57.640
And that's because you are the Great Hero!

06:59.940 --> 07:01.980
This old man's gone off the deep end.

07:13.070 --> 07:13.740
Hey!

07:13.960 --> 07:15.970
Why are <i>you</i> here?

07:15.970 --> 07:17.840
This is the advanced class!

07:17.840 --> 07:21.620
I took the exam for the lower classes, 
but I was told to come here.

07:22.310 --> 07:24.170
Did you bribe someone?!

07:24.170 --> 07:24.880
What?

07:25.330 --> 07:27.370
Did you gain back-door 
admission into this school?!

07:27.370 --> 07:31.380
You must have cheated somehow to be
 placed straight into the advanced class!

07:31.920 --> 07:37.140
Besides, this isn't the kind of academy 
that admits halfhearted people like you!

07:37.140 --> 07:38.950
Don't call me halfhearted!

07:38.950 --> 07:40.120
I'm dead serious.

07:40.120 --> 07:42.480
About making 100 friends here.

07:42.480 --> 07:43.150
What?

07:43.150 --> 07:44.400
I'm Blade!

07:44.400 --> 07:45.520
Let's be friends!

07:45.520 --> 07:46.020
What?

07:46.020 --> 07:47.190
I'm Blade!

07:47.190 --> 07:48.650
Wh-What do you want?

07:48.650 --> 07:50.070
I'm Blade!

07:50.070 --> 07:51.070
Let's be friends!

07:51.070 --> 07:52.280
I'm Blade!

07:52.380 --> 07:53.590
I'm Blade!

07:53.590 --> 07:55.280
Let's be friends!

07:53.890 --> 07:55.280
Listen to me!

07:56.220 --> 07:57.540
I'm listening.

07:59.340 --> 08:01.330
D-Don't pat my head!

08:05.330 --> 08:06.590
Whoa.

08:07.630 --> 08:09.820
The instructor has asked
 everyone to assemble.

08:10.430 --> 08:11.770
I'll be right there.

08:11.770 --> 08:13.110
I'm Blade!

08:14.450 --> 08:15.940
He's asking for your name.

08:15.940 --> 08:17.700
Is that a command?

08:17.700 --> 08:18.850
She's always like this.

08:18.850 --> 08:20.520
I'm Blade!

08:20.790 --> 08:22.650
You need to listen when people are talking.

08:22.650 --> 08:23.640
Sophie.

08:24.900 --> 08:26.350
I see!

08:26.350 --> 08:27.320
I'm Blade!

08:27.320 --> 08:28.440
Nice to meet you!

08:29.770 --> 08:30.690
Instructor!

08:31.260 --> 08:32.920
Wh-What is it?

08:32.920 --> 08:36.570
I'd like to test the 
transfer student's ability.

08:36.570 --> 08:40.000
Well, that wasn't in today's lesson plan...

08:40.000 --> 08:41.790
You don't mind, right?

08:42.610 --> 08:43.540
Go ahead...

08:49.290 --> 08:51.600
That's made of enchanted metal, right?

08:51.600 --> 08:53.300
And what if it is?

08:53.680 --> 08:54.880
Just so you know,

08:54.880 --> 08:58.260
simply slicing through it is something 
all the advanced students can do.

08:59.290 --> 09:01.200
Your job is to prove yourself 
to everyone here.

09:01.200 --> 09:05.190
If you can't, I'll have you admit to your 
illicit entry and leave the academy.

09:05.530 --> 09:08.260
The advanced class is on 
a whole different level.

09:08.260 --> 09:09.810
How many levels are we talking?

09:09.810 --> 09:12.400
Huh? W-Well... two...

09:12.400 --> 09:13.600
No, three!

09:13.600 --> 09:15.200
It's three whole levels different!

09:16.020 --> 09:18.350
I see. Three levels, huh?

09:18.350 --> 09:20.500
Then, Second Sword should do.

09:24.990 --> 09:27.180
Wait, the shape of his fighting spirit...

09:27.740 --> 09:28.920
Dragon Series?!

09:28.920 --> 09:30.960
Dragon Series? Wait!

09:38.030 --> 09:40.550
Dragon Eater!

09:56.890 --> 09:57.820
Cough.

09:58.730 --> 10:01.830
Hmm... Meh.

10:06.130 --> 10:07.330
Blade.

10:08.160 --> 10:12.340
Who in the world... <i>are</i> you?

10:20.720 --> 10:23.010
I-I'm ordinary!

10:23.430 --> 10:26.020
Just your exceedingly average,
ordinary person!

10:27.910 --> 10:31.020
Ordinary... Ordinary?!

10:38.530 --> 10:41.530
No, the best thing they 
serve is their hamburger!

10:43.960 --> 10:44.720
Hey!

10:46.350 --> 10:48.830
Seriously, what's your deal?

10:48.830 --> 10:50.540
Like I said, I'm just ordinary.

10:50.540 --> 10:52.520
And that's why she messed up!

10:52.520 --> 10:53.970
What, for real?

10:53.970 --> 10:56.510
Hey! There are seats here!

10:58.060 --> 11:01.050
Hey! Over here!

11:04.240 --> 11:05.840
What's gotten into them?

11:05.840 --> 11:09.550
This table is basically reserved for me.

11:09.550 --> 11:12.940
Wait... are you being bullied?

11:12.940 --> 11:14.000
You can talk to me about it.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.940
You're a real moron.

11:16.510 --> 11:19.700
Everyone's scared of me.

11:20.100 --> 11:22.700
Scared of you? Why?

11:27.960 --> 11:30.190
Whoa, what <i>is</i> this?!

11:30.190 --> 11:33.120
I'm not sure what it is, but it's great!

11:33.120 --> 11:35.640
Huh? It's just curry.

11:35.640 --> 11:36.500
Tonkatsu curry.

11:36.500 --> 11:38.760
So it's called tonkatsu curry?!

11:38.760 --> 11:40.250
Tonkatsu curry is super amazing!

11:40.250 --> 11:42.270
The guy who invented it was a real genius!

11:42.270 --> 11:45.320
I take back what I said about you.

11:45.320 --> 11:46.410
What was that again?

11:46.410 --> 11:49.580
I mean when I accused you 
of illicit entry here!

11:49.580 --> 11:50.400
Did you say that?

11:50.400 --> 11:51.690
I sure did!

11:51.690 --> 11:54.690
It's been bothering me,
and you don't even remember?!

11:56.110 --> 11:59.640
Since I don't remember,
you shouldn't let it bother you.

11:59.640 --> 12:03.450
I admit you've got a bit of talent.

12:03.450 --> 12:05.010
So, well...

12:06.220 --> 12:07.280
I'm sorry.

12:08.800 --> 12:09.790
Did you say something?

12:10.070 --> 12:13.130
I swear! You're so...

12:13.670 --> 12:15.320
You have my thanks.

12:15.320 --> 12:17.580
You've done so much to help me.

12:17.580 --> 12:19.550
Wh-What's this all of a sudden?!

12:19.850 --> 12:21.880
I'm a new transfer, right?

12:21.880 --> 12:23.980
I thought I wouldn't be 
able to make any friends.

12:23.980 --> 12:26.830
Huh? Friends? Who?

12:28.040 --> 12:30.830
Wait, m-me?!

12:30.830 --> 12:31.520
Yeah.

12:31.520 --> 12:34.350
Look, we're eating lunch together.

12:34.350 --> 12:35.150
That makes us pals!

12:36.240 --> 12:40.650
W-Well, I don't mind being your friend...

12:41.140 --> 12:42.090
That was easy.

12:42.090 --> 12:44.150
The Empress is so quick to fall.

13:00.650 --> 13:02.150
Seriously, what's with him?

13:02.710 --> 13:05.310
Eating together makes you friends?

13:05.310 --> 13:06.380
How absurd.

13:07.920 --> 13:10.260
Friends, he said...

13:14.700 --> 13:15.920
Yay!

13:15.920 --> 13:17.900
My very first friend!

13:35.110 --> 13:37.290
Surrender yourself to me.

13:49.280 --> 13:52.540
Destroy! Slash! Burn!

13:52.540 --> 13:53.720
Shut up!

13:54.000 --> 13:57.050
I'm the next head of the Flaming family!

13:57.050 --> 13:59.650
I won't give in to the likes of you!

14:13.710 --> 14:15.950
Leonard, take this fight seriously!

14:15.950 --> 14:16.920
Dear me.

14:16.920 --> 14:18.620
We may be simulating a real fight,

14:18.620 --> 14:22.460
but I'd rather not wield 
my lance against a lady!

14:25.710 --> 14:27.720
Wow! So awesome!

14:27.720 --> 14:30.220
Come! It's time for this show to begin!

14:41.930 --> 14:43.210
How merciless.

14:43.210 --> 14:44.740
It seems I've lost.

14:45.280 --> 14:46.570
Earnest?

14:57.880 --> 15:01.560
The Empress has been kind of scary lately.

15:01.560 --> 15:02.540
Next!

15:10.250 --> 15:12.300
If you continue this...

15:34.960 --> 15:36.370
I admit defeat.

15:38.960 --> 15:41.120
You're up next, Blade!

15:41.420 --> 15:42.690
Huh, me?

15:42.690 --> 15:46.590
That Dragon Series of yours 
is no big deal if I dodge it!

15:46.900 --> 15:48.710
I mean, I don't mind.

15:49.460 --> 15:52.250
But will you be all right in that condition?

15:52.250 --> 15:53.750
Shut up!

15:53.750 --> 15:55.060
I'll be fine.

15:56.280 --> 15:57.350
Let's go!

16:01.010 --> 16:02.010
Oh, no!

16:04.930 --> 16:06.650
Hey, Earnest!

16:14.080 --> 16:15.660
There's nothing I can do.

16:15.660 --> 16:17.300
Don't say that!

16:17.300 --> 16:19.350
Make her better, like you did for me!

16:19.350 --> 16:22.920
I can heal diseases and injuries, 
even from the brink of death.

16:22.920 --> 16:25.670
But spells and curses are 
outside of my expertise.

16:27.730 --> 16:28.920
Where am I?

16:30.240 --> 16:32.530
You passed out.

16:32.530 --> 16:33.890
Don't you remember?

16:33.890 --> 16:34.930
I...

16:36.720 --> 16:37.700
Don't tell me...

16:39.850 --> 16:40.970
Just calm down!

16:40.970 --> 16:43.860
Did I... um... do something?

16:43.860 --> 16:46.040
Something really awful?

16:46.040 --> 16:47.230
Really awful?

16:47.230 --> 16:49.110
No, you just suddenly fell unconscious.

16:49.540 --> 16:52.310
Oh, it was really awful carrying you here.

16:52.800 --> 16:53.790
Y-You dummy!

16:53.790 --> 16:55.740
I'm not that heavy!

16:56.070 --> 16:58.000
You should rest a little longer.

16:58.000 --> 16:59.040
That affliction of yours...

16:59.040 --> 17:00.490
Stop it!

17:00.490 --> 17:02.460
I feel better now.

17:02.460 --> 17:03.790
No. Get back in bed.

17:03.790 --> 17:04.700
Out of my way.

17:04.700 --> 17:06.170
I'm not budging.

17:06.170 --> 17:10.170
It seems like Earnest feels okay,
so why not let her go?

17:10.440 --> 17:12.420
I'll keep an eye on her instead.

17:12.420 --> 17:13.350
Fine.

17:13.350 --> 17:15.170
That's a promise.

17:17.790 --> 17:19.180
Seriously?

17:22.650 --> 17:24.340
I can walk on my own.

17:24.340 --> 17:26.190
You can lean on me, you know.

17:27.900 --> 17:29.760
We're friends, after all.

17:29.760 --> 17:33.080
Don't tell anyone what you 
heard in the infirmary.

17:48.980 --> 17:51.520
Looks like I owe that old man now.

17:51.520 --> 17:52.880
Not that I mind.

18:09.720 --> 18:11.190
There we go.

18:11.190 --> 18:13.480
Rosewood Academy's data...

18:14.820 --> 18:17.790
So that demon sword's name is Asmodeus?

18:17.790 --> 18:19.450
Dunno why, but it gives me the creeps.

18:23.420 --> 18:24.500
Quiet down.

18:28.820 --> 18:30.210
I see now.

18:30.840 --> 18:33.340
Why do you want to talk in private?

18:33.680 --> 18:35.960
Are you trying to threaten me?

18:35.960 --> 18:36.880
Huh?

18:36.880 --> 18:38.310
Why would I threaten you?

18:38.310 --> 18:40.590
Maybe you want my spot as top student.

18:40.980 --> 18:42.680
I couldn't care less about that.

18:42.680 --> 18:44.640
What's more important is you.

18:44.640 --> 18:46.100
I'm interested in you.

18:46.100 --> 18:46.920
What?!

18:46.920 --> 18:48.580
Wait, that's, well...

18:48.580 --> 18:52.480
I said we could be friends, 
but anything more is...

18:52.480 --> 18:54.980
I know the secret behind your sword.

18:58.750 --> 19:00.740
That sword has its own will,

19:01.110 --> 19:03.680
and grants its owner tremendous power.

19:03.680 --> 19:07.000
But you don't have full ownership of it.

19:09.010 --> 19:10.250
How did that happen?

19:11.560 --> 19:13.470
When I was six years old,

19:13.470 --> 19:19.260
I unknowingly laid my hands on a cursed 
demon sword in the Flaming family's custody.

19:19.740 --> 19:22.220
It tried to take over my body

19:22.220 --> 19:25.260
and the demon sword's will flowed through me,
hungering for blood and carnage.

19:25.660 --> 19:29.970
Ever since, I've been 
holding back those urges.

19:29.970 --> 19:33.710
As soon as I let my guard down, 
I can hear it still, to this day.

19:33.710 --> 19:38.210
The voice of Asmodeus,
begging me to let it slash and burn.

19:38.210 --> 19:40.730
But it hasn't taken over.

19:40.730 --> 19:41.810
No.

19:41.810 --> 19:43.740
Thanks to my stubbornness.

19:43.740 --> 19:44.960
There is a way.

19:44.960 --> 19:46.290
I know that much.

19:46.290 --> 19:51.250
I need the demon sword to
acknowledge me as its owner, right?

19:51.250 --> 19:52.380
But I can't do that.

19:52.880 --> 19:54.630
What if I fail?

19:54.630 --> 19:56.540
Then a bloodthirsty demon would come to life!

19:56.540 --> 19:57.630
It'll be okay.

19:57.630 --> 19:58.660
What?!

19:58.660 --> 20:00.460
How can you say something so irresponsible?!

20:00.460 --> 20:01.670
If the demon comes to life...

20:01.670 --> 20:04.180
Like I said, it'll be okay.

20:04.180 --> 20:04.840
What?

20:05.390 --> 20:07.920
If that happens, I'll cut it down.

20:07.920 --> 20:09.210
That's...

20:12.560 --> 20:14.190
Don't think I can do it?

20:15.960 --> 20:17.430
I think you can.

20:17.890 --> 20:19.570
So what's the problem?

20:19.570 --> 20:20.760
Nothing at all.

20:27.580 --> 20:29.250
Demon Sword Asmodeus!

20:29.250 --> 20:31.660
I am Earnest Flaming.

20:31.660 --> 20:34.010
I beseech thee to form a pact with me!

20:37.090 --> 20:39.340
Obey thy oath from days bygone,

20:39.340 --> 20:41.970
and receive my being within thy own!

20:41.970 --> 20:43.600
Try my strength.

20:43.600 --> 20:45.680
See if thou can consume me!

20:47.140 --> 20:48.890
So be it.

20:49.280 --> 20:51.640
I have faith in you, Earnest.

20:51.640 --> 20:53.830
I have faith as well,

20:53.830 --> 20:57.480
that you'll bring this all to an end,
no matter what happens.

21:05.400 --> 21:07.320
So you must be Asmodeus.

21:07.750 --> 21:09.590
I'll keep it brief.

21:09.590 --> 21:11.800
Submit yourself to me.

21:11.800 --> 21:13.500
I am fire!

21:13.500 --> 21:15.370
I am power!

21:15.370 --> 21:20.550
I am pure violence that 
reigns over all destruction!

21:21.800 --> 21:24.370
Looks like it means a fight, then.

21:24.370 --> 21:25.730
Bring it on!

21:38.450 --> 21:40.490
Destroy, destroy, destroy!

21:40.490 --> 21:42.400
Kill, kill, kill!

21:42.400 --> 21:44.690
Burn, burn, burn!

21:46.000 --> 21:48.110
Oh, what fun!

21:48.400 --> 21:50.430
I don't want to hold back!

21:50.430 --> 21:53.240
Not when there's so much 
to destroy around me!

21:53.240 --> 21:56.720
My house, my family, my friends!

22:02.160 --> 22:03.360
That's right.

22:03.360 --> 22:05.770
I can fight now, thanks to him.

22:05.770 --> 22:08.970
Even if I fail, I know he'll take it down.

22:09.540 --> 22:11.270
Which is why I'll fight,

22:11.270 --> 22:12.560
of my own will.

22:12.560 --> 22:14.490
For the sake of my own pride!

22:16.140 --> 22:17.350
My name...

22:19.030 --> 22:20.690
My name is Earnest!

22:21.280 --> 22:23.360
Earnest Flaming!

22:52.660 --> 22:54.720
I made it back.

22:56.560 --> 22:57.580
Welcome back.

23:07.740 --> 23:09.700
What, really?

23:08.950 --> 23:11.360
Yeah! And then Kassim was like...

23:10.350 --> 23:11.360
Good morning.

23:23.750 --> 23:26.570
Does it look weird on me?

23:26.570 --> 23:28.500
You look quite splendid!

23:28.500 --> 23:29.760
Uh-huh!
